Duas horas Sr.

366
00:34:37,879 --> 00:34:39,229
Sammy

367
00:34:41,029 --> 00:34:42,379
Sammy

368
00:34:43,169 --> 00:34:45,093
Sra. Salama.

369
00:34:45,328 --> 00:34:46,657
Que bom te ver.

370
00:34:46,878 --> 00:34:48,432
Tem alguém no meu apartamento.

371
00:34:48,433 --> 00:34:49,750
O que quer dizer?

372
00:34:49,751 --> 00:34:51,629
Vi alguém entrar
